    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated · 22 April 2026</p>

    <p>These Terms ("Terms") govern your use of the Nouri mobile app (the "App") operated by Brian Chan (the "Operator," "we," "us"). By installing or using Nouri you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the App.</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Important — not medical advice</strong>
      Nouri is an informational tool. The analyses it provides are generated by AI and may be inaccurate or incomplete. Nouri is <strong>not</strong> a substitute for professional medical or dietary advice, especially for severe food allergies. If you have a diagnosed allergy or medical condition, always verify ingredients directly on the product packaging and consult a qualified professional.
    </div>

    <h2><span class="num">§ 01</span>Who can use Nouri</h2>
    <p>You must be at least 13 years old (or 16 in the EEA) to use Nouri. If you are under the age of majority in your country, you may only use the App with the involvement of a parent or guardian.</p>

    <h2><span class="num">§ 02</span>What Nouri does</h2>
    <p>Nouri lets you scan the nutrition label of a food product with your device's camera, sends that image to an AI model for analysis, and returns a structured summary — ingredients, macronutrients, allergen flags, and whether the product aligns with the dietary preferences you have set in your profile. Nouri also keeps a pantry and scan history for your convenience.</p>

    <h2><span class="num">§ 03</span>Accuracy and AI limitations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Nouri uses large language models (currently Google's Gemini) to interpret label images. These models can make mistakes — misread text, miss ingredients, or hallucinate details.</li>
      <li>Allergen detection is a best-effort signal, not a guarantee. <strong>Never rely solely on Nouri to avoid an allergen</strong> — always read the product label yourself.</li>
      <li>Dietary match results (e.g., "vegan," "halal") reflect the app's interpretation and may not meet the exact definition used by certification bodies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2><span class="num">§ 04</span>Your account</h2>
    <p>You are responsible for safeguarding access to the device and the Google/Apple account you use to sign in. Notify us promptly if you believe your account has been accessed without your permission.</p>

    <h2><span class="num">§ 05</span>Free and paid tiers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The free tier includes a capped number of scans per calendar month.</li>
      <li><strong>Nouri Plus</strong> is an optional subscription that unlocks additional scans, pantry features, and forthcoming features. Subscription prices are shown in-App before purchase.</li>
      <li>Payments are processed by Google Play or Apple. Billing, cancellation, and refunds are handled through the platform you purchased on, subject to their terms.</li>
      <li>Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel subscriptions in your Google Play or Apple account settings.</li>
    </ul>

